=== 4. install.sh's prefix/sudo step with real npm, prefix <scratch>/home/.npm-0b7e5a2c-3f1d-4c6e-9a8b-1234567890ab (does not exist yet)
--- npm 12.2.3, before:
  NPM_PREFIX=/usr/local  SUDO=sudo
  created: nothing
--- npm 12.2.3, after:
  NPM_PREFIX=<scratch>/home/.npm-0b7e5a2c-3f1d-4c6e-9a8b-1234567890ab  SUDO=<none>
  created: <scratch>/home/.npm-0b7e5a2c-3f1d-4c6e-9a8b-1234567890ab/lib
--- npm 10.9.7, before:
  NPM_PREFIX=/usr/local  SUDO=sudo
